  "description": "The Geek Vape Aegis Boost 3 Vape Kit is the latest addition to the renowned Aegis series, known for its ruggedness, high-performance capabilities, and user-friendly design. Powered by a built-in 3000mAh battery, the Aegis Boost 3 delivers up to 50W of output, making it perfect for sub-ohm vaping with high-VG e-liquids for rich flavour and dense cloud production. This versatile kit offers six 'draw modes' to customise your vaping experience, including Smart, Power, Boost, Memory, Eco, and TCR modes, giving you total control over your device’s performance. Additionally, the Boost 3 is equipped with advanced biosensing technology for locking and unlocking the device with ease, ensuring enhanced safety and convenience. Designed to endure the toughest conditions, the Aegis Boost 3 features Geek Vape’s industry-leading IP68-rated tri-proof protection, making it resistant to water, dust, and shocks. Whether you're on an adventure or looking for a reliable everyday vape, the Aegis Boost 3 has you covered. The device's top airflow leakproof pod can hold 2ml of e-liquid (TPD version), and it is compatible with Geek Vape B Series coils , which are designed to maximise flavour and extend coil longevity. The ergonomic design and 0.96” display ensure the Aegis Boost 3 is both comfortable and intuitive to use. Unlock the ultimate vaping experience by selecting a premium vape liquid that harmonises with your kit. We recommend using High VG (sub-ohm) E-liquid with the pre-installed 0.2ohm coil and Nic Salts E-Liquid with the 0.6ohm coil Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
